*HEADING
Model: {{ project.name }} - Natural Frequency & Modal Analysis
Generated by MAEngine - Mechanical Analysis Engine
Units: {{ project.units.value }}
**
** =============================================================
** GEOMETRY & MESH
** =============================================================
*INCLUDE, INPUT={{ mesh_file }}
**
** =============================================================
** MATERIAL DEFINITIONS
** =============================================================
{% for mat in project.materials %}
*MATERIAL, NAME={{ mat.name }}
*ELASTIC
{{ mat.elastic.youngs_modulus }}, {{ mat.elastic.poissons_ratio }}
*DENSITY
{{ mat.density }}
{% endfor %}
**
** =============================================================
** SECTION ASSIGNMENTS
** =============================================================
{% if eall_members %}
*ELSET, ELSET=EALL
{{ eall_members | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% for sec in sections %}
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET={{ sec.elset }}, MATERIAL={{ sec.material }}
{% endfor %}
**
** =============================================================
** MODAL EIGENVALUE EXTRACTION STEP (LANCZOS)
** =============================================================
{% for step in project.steps %}
*STEP
*FREQUENCY
{{ step.num_modes or 10 }}
**
** --- BOUNDARY CONDITIONS (Restraints for Eigenvalues) ---
**
*BOUNDARY
{% for bc in step.boundary_conditions %}
{% if bc.type.value == "fixed" %}
{{ bc.target_set }}, 1, 3, 0.0
{% elif bc.type.value == "displacement" %}
{# one line per prescribed component; a block tag on its own line keeps the line breaks #}
{% for dof, value in [(1, bc.u1), (2, bc.u2), (3, bc.u3)] if value is not none %}
{{ bc.target_set }}, {{ dof }}, {{ dof }}, {{ value }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
**
** --- OUTPUT REQUESTS (Eigenvector Mode Shapes & Frequencies) ---
**
*NODE FILE
U
*EL FILE
S, E
*END STEP
{% endfor %}

